# Not committed on purpose: while salt-agent-sdk's public npm version (0.1.0)
# lags behind this repo's target (^0.7.1), a local install records a
# `"link": true` entry pointing at "../salt-agent-sdk" -- a path that only
# exists on a machine with that sibling checkout. Regenerate locally with
# `npm install && npm install ../salt-agent-sdk --no-save`. Recommit this
# file once salt-agent-sdk 0.7.1+ is actually published. See AGENTS.md.
